            "text": "For Sydneysiders seeking the perfect sweet surprise for a birthday, Australia boasts a delightful array of online lolly shops that offer diverse selections and convenient delivery options. From nostalgic childhood favourites to gourmet delights and international treats, these stores ensure a memorable and delicious gift.\n\nHere are some of the best online lolly shops in Australia for a birthday gift, keeping a Sydney shopper in mind:\n\n*   **Lollylicious** specializes in handcrafted chocolate and lolly bouquets, arrangements, and hampers. They use popular brands like Ferrero, Lindt, Cadbury, Nestle, and Mars, offering a unique alternative to traditional gifts. Lollylicious delivers to Sydney, NSW, ACT, VIC & QLD, and can also create custom orders, including corporate gifts with branding.\n*   **Dessert Boxes** offers candy collection boxes that can be customised with the recipient's name. They provide Australia-wide delivery, with same-day delivery available for Birthday Dessert Boxes in Sydney and Wollongong.\n*   **Goody Goody Gum Drops** is a family-run online lolly shop with a huge selection, including single-coloured lollies, Australian-made chocolates, retro lollies, and options for gluten-free and sugar-free diets. They offer affordable and fast delivery across Sydney and all of New South Wales.\n*   **The Old Lolly Shop** provides hand-packed lolly gift boxes filled with childhood favourites and retro sweets. They ship fast Australia-wide and offer a free personal note with each order, with free shipping on orders over $100.\n*   **Wicked Sweets** is a go-to online lolly shop for international candies, sweets, and treats, alongside Australian favourites. They offer Australia-wide delivery and have physical locations across Sydney. Gift boxes are also a planned offering.\n*   **Sweet As** offers a fantastic range of lolly and chocolate gift boxes for all occasions, including birthday and corporate gifts. They have options for nostalgic treats, sour lollies, British sweets, classic party lollies, and chocolates. Australia-wide delivery is available, and for selected suburbs in Melbourne, they even offer same-day lolly box delivery. You can also add a personalised gift note at checkout.\n*   **Edible Blooms** provides a variety of lolly hampers and chocolate gifts, with options for same-day delivery to Sydney if ordered within a specific timeframe. Their hampers are often overflowing with chocolates and sweet treats.\n*   **Lolly Kingdom** boasts a huge range of over 300 lolly options, allowing customers to create their own pick-and-mix bags. They offer various themed lolly boxes, including \"Birthday Box\" options, and ship quickly Australia-wide.\n*   **iCandy** provides a sweet delivery service, offering unique lollies perfect for birthdays. They pride themselves on high-quality products and offer free next-day delivery within a 10km radius of Stanhope Gardens, NSW, with Australia-wide shipping via Aus Post for their Pick & Mix Candy Boxes.\n*   **The Lolly Warehouse** offers an extensive range of birthday lollies from Australia, the US, the UK, and other countries, acting as a one-stop shop for bulk confectionery needs. They deliver Australia-wide, including Sydney, allowing you to stock up and have birthday lollies delivered directly to your door."
          }
        ],
